{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17847","headline":"奉和严司空重阳日同崔常侍崔郎及诸公登龙山落帽台佳宴 · 令狐楚","name":"奉和严司空重阳日同崔常侍崔郎及诸公登龙山落帽台佳宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢公秋思渺天涯，蜡屐登高爲菊花。\n贵重近臣光绮席，笑怜从事落乌纱。\n萸房暗绽红珠朵，茗碗寒供白露芽。\n咏碎龙山归出号，马奔流电妓奔车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}